# SEO improvements — Publish website

Cross-reference: [seo.mdc](./seo.mdc) (baseline rules: title, meta description, one H1, image alt, friendly URLs).

## Purpose

Guide implementation and PR review for public SEO (technical, on-page, performance, social). Aligns with Lighthouse / third-party SEO audits.

## Technical SEO

| Item | Done when | Primary locations |
|------|-----------|-------------------|
| **robots.txt** | `GET /robots.txt` returns `200`, `text/plain`, `Allow: /`, and a valid absolute `Sitemap:` line | [Pages/RobotsTxt.cshtml](../Pages/RobotsTxt.cshtml), `App:SelfUrl` / `Seo:PublicSiteUrl` |
| **sitemap.xml** | `GET /sitemap.xml` returns well-formed XML, `urlset` namespace `http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9`, absolute `<loc>` URLs | [Pages/SitemapXml.cshtml](../Pages/SitemapXml.cshtml) |
| **Canonical** | Each important page has **exactly one** `<link rel="canonical" href="https://host/path">` pointing to the preferred live URL | Landing: [Pages/Index.cshtml](../Pages/Index.cshtml); others already use `@Model.Seo.CanonicalUrl` or similar |
| **JSON-LD** | `WebSite` schema remains valid; `url` matches public home URL | [Pages/Index.cshtml](../Pages/Index.cshtml) |

## Hreflang and multilingual URLs

**Current behavior:** UI culture is driven by cookie (`SetLanguage`) and query, not by distinct URLs per language.

- **Minimum:** Do not emit misleading `hreflang` pairs that all point to the same URL.
- **Phase 2 (recommended for Google):** Introduce per-locale URLs (e.g. path prefix `/en/...`) with reciprocal `link rel="alternate" hreflang="vi|en|x-default"` on every localized template.

Document locale URL strategy before adding hreflang.

## On-page SEO

| Item | Done when | Notes |
|------|-----------|--------|
| **H1** | Exactly **one** visible (or one visible + none duplicated) `h1` on the landing hero | [Pages/Shared/Landing/_HeroSlider.cshtml](../Pages/Shared/Landing/_HeroSlider.cshtml): first slide / fallback uses `h1`, others `h2` |
| **Title length** | `Landing:PageTitle` per culture is roughly **50–60** characters, unique, human-readable | [Localization/Publish_website/*.json](../Localization/Publish_website/) |
| **Meta description** | Present, aligned with page content, not keyword-stuffed | Landing `Index`; section `@Meta` on other pages |
| **Image alt** | Meaningful `alt` for informative images; decorative assets use `alt=""` + `aria-hidden="true"` on wrapper | Landing partials under `Pages/Shared/Landing/` |

## Performance (Core Web Vitals–oriented)

| Item | Done when |
|------|-----------|
| **INP / TBT** | Non-critical scripts use `defer` where order-safe; avoid long main-thread work on first interaction |
| **Speed Index** | Large hero imagery uses responsive / compressed formats (existing banner webp helpers in `IndexModel`) |
| **Unused assets** | Periodically audit template CSS/JS; remove dead template includes when safe |
| **DOM size** | If audit tools fail to measure, re-test after deploy; simplify redundant nodes only when measured |

## Mobile friendliness

- Viewport must **not** use `user-scalable=no` / `maximum-scale=1` for primary public pages (accessibility + audit tools).
- Tap targets and base font sizes meet [khhub.css](../wwwroot/template/css/khhub.css) / design system (≥ ~44px touch targets where possible).

## Social links

- Real outbound URLs only; no `href="#"`.
- Configure under `Social:*` in appsettings; hide icon when URL is empty.
- Optional: `rel="noopener noreferrer"` on external links.

## Verification checklist (before merge)

1. `curl -sI https://<host>/robots.txt` → `200`, `content-type: text/plain`
2. `curl -s https://<host>/sitemap.xml` → parse XML, all `<loc>` absolute HTTPS in production
3. View-source home: single canonical, OG tags, one `h1`, viewport allows zoom
4. Lighthouse (mobile): performance + SEO + “best practices” spot-check
5. After production deploy: Google Search Console → sitemap submit, coverage spot-check

## Audit red-flag → remediation map

| Audit theme | Remediation |
|-------------|-------------|
| No sitemap | `SitemapXml` page + `Sitemap:` in robots |
| No robots | `RobotsTxt` page |
| Canonical issues | Add missing canonical + OG on landing `Index` |
| Missing H1 | Hero slider: first slide / fallback `h1` |
| Title too short | Lengthen localized `Landing:PageTitle` |
| Missing alt | Replace empty alts with localized or contextual text; decorative SVGs `aria-hidden` |
| Social placeholders | `Social:*` config + footer partial |
| Mobile viewport | Remove zoom lock on landing |
| INP / TBT | `defer` on landing scripts (order preserved) |
| Hreflang | Defer until URL-per-locale exists |
| DOM metric unavailable | Re-run tool on public URL; reduce weight if still failing |
